# `krowk status` with no config: the seven implicit instances, none ready
# (no key, no login, no claude or codex on this PATH), exit 3 with the rows
# as the failure's details; then a key, which makes one ready, exit 0. The
# `--json` rows are the documented shape: every key on every row. The key
# is a sentinel that must appear nowhere below.
krowk status
krowk status --json
@env ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-golden-SENTINEL-do-not-print
krowk status --json
krowk status --format human
krowk providers list --format human
